keys-title = Encryption and keys
keys-mode = Key
keys-mode-device = Device
keys-mode-password = Password
keys-mode-both = Device and password
keys-mode-device-info = The key lives in the phone's secure chip. The files cannot be read without the phone. No password to type.
keys-mode-password-info = The key comes from the password (Argon2id); the phone takes no part. Forget the password and the data is lost. Deleted data is not guaranteed to be gone: a password has no key to destroy.
keys-mode-both-info = Both the phone and the password are needed. A copy of the memory without the phone is useless even with a weak password. Forget the password and the data is lost.
